          "value": "Early on, the red dashed trend line still points slightly upward, but the daily line zigzags wildly—zeros and mid-forties spikes sit side by side—so the ramp is modest compared with the noise. The takeaway is a tentative uptick in usage while the person is still settling into a rhythm, not a smooth climb."
